# Malformed absolute-path writes: a Windows-style path passed to a file-writing
# tool creates a file whose NAME contains literal backslashes (e.g.
# "C:\Users\x\docs\note.md") instead of writing to that location. These names are
# illegal on Windows and break clone/checkout there. Ignore so they are never
# committed; delete any that appear.
C:\\*
*C:\\*
test-output/

# SEC-H5（批次 1）：docker.sh 本地生成的 PPT_CONVERTER_SECRET——勿入库
docker/.ppt-converter-secret

